+| pointed to by 'aSPtr' and 'bSPtr' is a NaN, stores the combined NaN result
+| at the location pointed to by 'zSPtr'.  If either original floating-point
+| value is a signaling NaN, the invalid exception is raised.
+*----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
+void
